{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Accuracy checkpoint. src/rebar/graph/_links.py defines seven canonical relations. docs/user-guide.md omits caused_by from its relation list, while AGENTS.md says six relations. Documentation should derive the inventory or enforce parity against CANONICAL_RELATIONS. The same check confirms that docs/config.md names the wrong ADR number for both cross-ticket overlap and transport retry. No project files changed."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787291091245447001,"uuid":"54f51c44-9a0d-4732-be02-585092ad14fe"}